# ── Operator-supplied assets (assets/, 2026-09-11): SOURCE is tracked, bulk is not ──────────
# Tracked: assets/kestrel9_gfx/{booster/**, booster-stage.js, *.dc.html, github.md} +
#          assets/kestrel9_gfx/exports/kestrel9_cfd_1-1_m.stl (the FluidX3D input, 4.7 MB) +
#          assets/apollo_imu/{gimbal-scene.js, *.dc.html, ios-frame.jsx, uploads/p1_gimbal.c}.
# Not tracked: the zips, design-tool screenshots/pasted images, the print-scale STLs (regenerable
# from export-stl.js), the earlier Apollo export (apollo_imu_v1), and the FluidX3D checkout
# (clone https://github.com/ProjectPhysX/FluidX3D — 21 MB of skybox, not ours).
assets/*.zip
assets/**/shots/
assets/**/uploads/*.png
assets/**/.thumbnail
assets/**/support.js
assets/kestrel9_gfx/exports/*print*
assets/fluidx3d/
assets/apollo_imu_v1/
assets/apollo_imu/uploads/*\ (?).c
android/

